BT /F1 12 Tf 72 718 Td (A translation model without recurrence) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 72 699 Td (A report from the Calventis Institute for Machine Intelligence) Tj ET
BT /F1 14 Tf 72 680 Td (Summary) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 658 Td (Translation systems usually carry information along a sequence one step at a time. The network) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 644 Td (described here does not: the Calventis model is assembled entirely from weighted-key lookups,) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 630 Td (with no recurrent or convolutional part anywhere in it.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 616 Td (On two directions of the Halden corpus it beat the recurrent systems we trained, and it was) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 602 Td (cheaper to run in parallel. The largest configuration trained for 4.5 days on twelve accelerator) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 588 Td (cards.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 538 Td (Prepared for software testing. The text is fictional.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 297 36 Td (1) Tj ET
